      "cooked": "<p>I believe I was either listening to the Cardboard Jungle or GFBR podcast and Chris was a guest on there where he mentioned his notebook which has basically all SotM stories written out. &nbsp;I was wondering if there is ever a plan to eventually create an art/story book with these for us fans to possibly purchase once SotM has wrapped up. &nbsp;I think it would be cool if it was like the instruction manual where it gives bios, character concepts, timelines, etc. &nbsp;Just curious if this is in any future plans.</p>",
